This licence covers the mesedi-verify verifier in this directory ONLY. The
rest of this repository is proprietary and is not licensed by this file.

The verifier is MIT on purpose. It is the program that adjudicates whether
Mesedi's records hold up, and an auditor cannot be asked to trust a
verdict from a binary they are not permitted to read, modify, rebuild or
redistribute. A closed verifier would move the trust problem one level up
rather than solving it.

